cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The S.A.F.E. Intent Framework"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Corral"
    given-names: "Rogel S.J."

repository-code: "https://github.com/rogelsjcorral/safe-intent-framework"

abstract: >
  SAFE (Structured Automation For Execution) is a control framework for
  AI-assisted administrative automation. It defines enforceable execution
  phases including enumeration, snapshot, confirmation, execution,
  verification, and MER generation to improve traceability and operational
  safety for privileged automation workflows.
